 "brief": "Airstrikes targeting a tent positioned near Yarmouk Stadium in central Gaza City wounded 10 people, the Ma'an news agency reported. The incident occurred in the densely populated area surrounding the stadium, a facility that has served as a shelter for displaced Palestinians during the conflict.\n\nDetails on the circumstances of the strike and the condition of the wounded were not immediately available.",
